# Signing material never enters the repo: match keeps the certificate, CI's secrets the rest.
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.keychain-db
.env*
# What fastlane writes beside its files.
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/README.md
fastlane/test_output/
